  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CSO deltagande i Busan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSO participation in Busan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing of CSOs participation in Busan. The support will cover around 100 representatives from Southern CSOs and their participation in the next High-level meeting on Aid Effectiveness that will take place in Busan 29 November - 1st December 2011. The contribution is linked to the support given to Better Aid (IBON) and Open Forum (CONCORD) for their preparatory work for Busan 2009-2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering av CSO:ers deltagande i Busan. St&#xf6;det ber&#xe4;knas t&#xe4;cka 100 representanter fr&#xe5;n organisationer i Syd och deras deltagande i n&#xe4;sta H&#xf6;gniv&#xe5; m&#xf6;te om Bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet (HLF-4) i Busan 29 no - 1 dec 2011. Bidraget &#xe4;r l&#xe4;nkat till st&#xf6;det som getts f&#xf6;r Better Aid (IBON) och Open Forums (CONCORD) f&#xf6;rberedelsearbeten inf&#xf6;r Busan 2009-2011 (se beslut f&#xf6;r IBON 2009-004450).</narrative>
  </description>
